{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Income tax to apply only from \u00a350,000pa with a Maximum Income Level of \u00a3300,000",
        "additional_details": "We feel that there have been years of gross inequity in Britain, which have promoted a tax system that seems designed to make the divide between rich and poor increase exponentially.",
        "background": "We would like the current tax band system in this country to be replaced by a system where tax is calculated from a starting income of \u00a350,000, rising to a maximum income figure of around \u00a3300,000 per annum - any income above this amount being taxed at 100% in order to set a 'maximum income'.",
